{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This will provide you with an in-game walkthrough for the choices in Between Two Worlds. It will add additional text and icons to the choices you make throughout the game, helping to guide you to your preferred endings, as well as getting many of the achievements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i><u>You will also find an icon on the main menu to access a file with over 200 high quality (including 4k) wallpapers, phone backgrounds, and a bunch of concept art that I created during the making of the game!</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upon purchasing and downloading this DLC, a new item will show up in your Options menu, allowing you to enable and disable the walkthrough. It will start out as enabled by default.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note that this will not guide you to get all achievements, only some. The primary purpose is to help guide you through the game and ensure you can get as much content as possible from any given playthrough.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754820?t=1749750522","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754820?t=1749750522","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754820/c65f20be568611039e867a10126897c72dcb56ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749750522","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754820/c65f20be568611039e867a10126897c72dcb56ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749750522","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This will provide you with an in-game walkthrough for the choices in Between Two Worlds. It will add additional text and icons to the choices you make throughout the game, helping to guide you to your preferred endings, as well as getting many of the achievements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i><u>You will also find an icon on the main menu to access a file with over 200 high quality (including 4k) wallpapers, phone backgrounds, and a bunch of concept art that I created during the making of the game!</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upon purchasing and downloading this DLC, a new item will show up in your Options menu, allowing you to enable and disable the walkthrough. It will start out as enabled by default.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note that this will not guide you to get all achievements, only some. The primary purpose is to help guide you through the game and ensure you can get as much content as possible from any given playthrough.</p>","developers":["Drooskati Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1975280","name":"Between Two Worlds"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754820/5506c805634df5bebd2c2e6ca12961fd81221c3a/header.jpg?t=1749750522","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Between Two Wor